android-yara-engine

This repository contains build infrastructure, not an Android application,
JNI wrapper, detection rule pack, or a malware verdict service.

YARA-X upstream: https://github.com/VirusTotal/yara-x
Upstream release: v1.21.0
Upstream commit: 7b2637d4655155fdfaf68177edadb9a39406ece0
YARA-X is distributed under BSD-3-Clause. The original upstream license and
resolved Rust dependency notices accompany the release binary. The MIT license
at the repository root covers this build infrastructure only; it does not
relicense YARA-X, the Android NDK, Rust, or their dependencies.

The C API feature configuration is changed by the small patch in patches/.
No default analysis modules are enabled. The upstream engine implementation
is otherwise unchanged. Initially only arm64-v8a / Android API 24+ is built.
Cross-compilation and ELF checks are not Android runtime validation.
